{"type":"standard","title":"Juliana Stratton","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Juliana Stratton</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q27787878","titles":{"canonical":"Juliana_Stratton","normalized":"Juliana Stratton","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Juliana Stratton</span></span>"},"pageid":49803396,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/Juliana_Stratton_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1413,"height":1886},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375483369","tid":"d4b37510-b303-11f1-ae3d-3a93eddc5931","timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:54:06Z","description":"American politician (born 1965)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Juliana_Stratton"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Juliana_Stratton","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juliana_Stratton?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Juliana_Stratton"}},"extract":"Juliana R. Stratton is an American lawyer and politician who has served as the 48th lieutenant governor of Illinois since 2019. A progressive member of the Democratic Party, she was elected in 2018 and 2022 on a ticket with Governor JB Pritzker. Stratton is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 US Senate election in Illinois.","extract_html":"<p><b>Juliana R. Stratton</b> is an American lawyer and politician who has served as the 48th lieutenant governor of Illinois since 2019. A progressive member of the Democratic Party, she was elected in 2018 and 2022 on a ticket with Governor JB Pritzker. Stratton is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 US Senate election in Illinois.</p>"}